These terms cover probehive's own material: the gateware, the firmware, the
simulations, the scripts and the documentation.

The tree contains no third-party code.  The flake fetches what the build
needs, each under its own license: LiteX, LiteEth and LiteX-Boards
(BSD-2-Clause), VexRiscv as LiteX's pregenerated Verilog (MIT), and the
openXC7 toolchain or AMD's Vivado.  A bitstream built from this tree
contains LiteX's, LiteEth's and VexRiscv's gateware; passing one on, keep
their notices with it.

Unless you state otherwise, a contribution you intentionally submit for
inclusion in this repository is licensed under the same dual terms, without
any additional conditions.
